A change that breaks one feature: salaries in compact notation, "60K–76K € per year".
One line of the application changes. One test tagged @smoke fails in both browsers, and the visual comparison
shows the changed line as a picture. Case 8 uses it to practise reading and reproducing a failed run
(README.md, section 5).

    git apply labs/12-ci/red-run.patch        apply it, in the repository root
    git apply -R labs/12-ci/red-run.patch     take it back

